Source: kitty
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Dario Griffo <dariogriffo@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), wget, ca-certificates, xz-utils
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: kitty
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: kitty-terminfo (>= ${source:Upstream-Version}),
         kitty-shell-integration (>= ${source:Upstream-Version}),
         libc6 (>= 2.35),
         libx11-6,
         libx11-xcb1,
         libxcursor1,
         libxcb1,
         libxcb-xkb1,
         libdbus-1-3,
         libfontconfig1,
         libgl1,
         libegl1,
         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: kitty-doc, libcanberra0, libstartup-notification0
Suggests: imagemagick, fonts-noto-color-emoji
Provides: x-terminal-emulator
Description: fast, feature-rich, GPU based terminal emulator
 kitty supports modern terminal features like: graphics, unicode,
 true-color, OpenType ligatures, mouse protocol, focus tracking, and
 bracketed paste. It ships "kittens", small terminal programs (icat, ssh,
 diff, clipboard, themes, remote control, ...) run through the kitten
 command.
 .
 This package ships the official upstream prebuilt bundle, unmodified, under
 /opt/kitty with its own Python runtime and libraries, and links kitty and
 kitten into /usr/bin. Nothing is rebuilt from source. This is an unofficial
 package.

Package: kitty-terminfo
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: fast, feature-rich, GPU based terminal emulator (terminfo file)
 This package provides the xterm-kitty terminfo definition for the kitty
 terminal emulator so that it can easily be installed on remote systems.
 This is an unofficial package.

Package: kitty-shell-integration
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: fast, feature-rich, GPU based terminal emulator (shell integration files)
 This package provides kitty's shell integration files (bash, fish, zsh and
 the ssh kitten bootstrap) so that they can easily be installed on remote
 systems. This is an unofficial package.

Package: kitty-doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Section: doc
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: fast, feature-rich, GPU based terminal emulator (documentation)
 This package contains the HTML documentation for the kitty terminal
 emulator. This is an unofficial package.
